Subject: Share original frontend transform and textbox row layout

Upstream-base: 2c5c51e483b652d178ef06a44b83b07a0f97d2a6

Share original instance/parent transform and textbox row/offset equations with
checked native static-layout adapters. Preserve console algorithms and original
call sites; bound native row storage and reject non-progressing first-glyph wrap.
The native caller limits strings, scalar ranges, glyph metrics and formatting.
This does not select a timeline, full FE renderer or missing nlFont draw method.

